[ti:I Won’t Ride with the Choir]
[00:00.76][Intro]
[00:00.84]Yeah, another day in the sunshine
[00:05.20]Same script glowing from a pocket-sized sky
[00:11.60][Verse]
[00:11.68]I roll through the neighborhood, same porch, new screen
[00:14.64]Watch peace get traded for a louder scene
[00:17.24]A red alert flashes between the weather and the game
[00:22.08]Somebody found a way to put a price on blame
[00:25.16]Every hot take blows cold off the ocean side
[00:27.92]Keeping our hands on the wheel, our eyes fixed wide
[00:32.44]They sell a storm before a single cloud arrives
[00:35.68]Then count the clicks like coins on our sleepless nights
[00:38.52][Pre-Chorus]
[00:38.60]The code is calling all the shots tonight
[00:42.04]Putting fear beneath a pale blue light
[00:44.00]Keeping doubt alive, keeping tension high
[00:46.60]Made in a room where the windows never shine
[00:49.16]I won’t ride with the choir anymore
[00:54.36]I won’t bring their panic through my front door
[00:58.88]They can sell the ending, say the ship will drown
[01:01.80]I’m stepping out while the sun’s still out
[01:04.08]Round and round, let the replay fade
[01:06.96]I’m taking back the peace they made me trade
[01:19.88][Verse]
[01:19.96]They debate tomorrow in a different pair of shoes
[01:22.28]Same old smoke, same manufactured news
[01:24.68]A wolf at the gate on a sponsored feed
[01:27.40]Just enough teeth to water every seed
[01:30.00]But my neighbor’s kid is drawing chalk on the lane
[01:32.76]And the coffee shop is laughing through the rain
[01:35.20]Maybe the world is more than the loudest sound
[01:37.52]Maybe truth is what is still here when I look around
[01:40.88]The code is calling all the shots tonight
[01:44.24]Putting fear beneath a pale blue light
[01:46.24]Keeping doubt alive, keeping tension high
[01:48.84]Made in a room where the windows never shine
[01:51.44]I won’t ride with the choir anymore
[01:56.60]I won’t bring their panic through my front door
[02:01.12]They can sell the ending, say the ship will drown
[02:04.04]I’m stepping out while the sun’s still out
[02:06.32]Round and round, let the replay fade
[02:08.92]I’m taking back the peace they made me trade
[02:12.92][Bridge]
[02:13.00]What if the future isn’t theirs to frame?
[02:15.56]What if the fire needs no borrowed flame?
[02:18.16]I turn the screen face-down on the table
[02:20.68]Hear my own breath, remember I’m able
[02:47.08][Chorus]
[02:47.16]I won’t ride with the choir anymore
[02:51.08]I won’t bring their panic through my front door
[02:55.64]They can sell the ending, say the ship will drown
[02:58.56]I’m stepping out while the sun’s still out
[03:00.84]Round and round, let the replay fade
[03:03.44]I’m taking back the peace they made me trade
